WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.184
Here are six of the module's
sixteen evidence questions,

2
00:00:03.184 --> 00:00:07.612
with the Graph call and the least-privileged
application permission for each.

3
00:00:07.612 --> 00:00:11.852
Who signed in, and when: list users
with sign-in activity selected,

4
00:00:11.852 --> 00:00:16.012
which needs User dot Read dot All
plus AuditLog dot Read dot All.

5
00:00:16.012 --> 00:00:18.568
Who's in a group, nested groups included:

6
00:00:18.568 --> 00:00:22.562
transitive members, with
GroupMember dot ReadBasic dot All.

7
00:00:22.562 --> 00:00:26.587
What the Conditional Access policies
say: Policy dot Read dot All.

8
00:00:26.587 --> 00:00:29.787
Who holds a role now: the
role assignment schedules.

9
00:00:29.787 --> 00:00:34.825
Which applications have secrets or
certificates: Application dot Read dot All.

10
00:00:34.825 --> 00:00:39.650
And who registered which authentication
methods: the registration details report.

11
00:00:39.650 --> 00:00:44.862
Every one of these is generally
available in Graph version one point oh,

12
00:00:44.862 --> 00:00:48.043
and each page lists it
in the global service,

13
00:00:48.043 --> 00:00:51.550
which GCC uses, and in the
GCC High and DoD clouds.
